OL,3,GNEWSAFans line street for EMF star's
OL,4,Afinal farewell
OL,5,
OL,6,FFans and residents of Derran "Derry"
OL,7,FBrownson's hometown have gathered to
OL,8,Fpay their respects to the founding
OL,9,Fmember of hit 90s band EMF.
OL,11,FA private funeral was held in
OL,12,FCinderford on Friday after Derry, 55,
OL,13,Fdied in August following a brain tumour
OL,14,Fdiagnosis, which he opened up to the
OL,15,FBBC about in 2025.
OL,17,FAs Derry's hearse passed through the
OL,18,Fstreets of the Forest of Dean town,
OL,19,Fgatherers clapped and threw flowers.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
