OL,3,GNEWSAFans line street for EMF star's
OL,4,Afinal farewell
OL,5,
OL,6,FIan Dench, Derry's bandmate, said:
OL,7,F"There was only one of Derry and people
OL,8,Floved him. He was so warm and would
OL,9,Ftalk to anyone."
